1
00:00:00,846 --> 00:00:02,916
(Penny:)It's getting creepy again.

2
00:00:11,257 --> 00:00:12,257
(Raj:)What?

3
00:00:12,258 --> 00:00:14,258
(Penny:)Just thinking about the day

4
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:15,660
(Penny:)I met you and Leonard.

5
00:00:15,661 --> 00:00:17,431
(Sheldon:)It was a Monday afternoon.

6
00:00:17,430 --> 00:00:20,630
(Sheldon:)You joined us for Indian food.

7
00:00:20,633 --> 00:00:23,033
(Penny:)Can you believe
it's been eight years?

8
00:00:23,035 --> 00:00:26,005
(Sheldon:)Yeah, and you're
still eating our food.

9
00:00:29,341 --> 00:00:30,871
(Penny:)I... can't remember a time

10
00:00:30,876 --> 00:00:33,676
(Penny:)you guys weren't in my life.

11
00:00:33,679 --> 00:00:36,249
(Sheldon:)I remember it perfectly.

12
00:00:37,450 --> 00:00:39,980
(Sheldon:)But I have an eidetic memory.

13
00:00:39,985 --> 00:00:42,555
(Sheldon:)If you're interested,
I also remember

14
00:00:42,555 --> 00:00:45,285
(Sheldon:)how much you owe us
for the food.

15
00:00:47,693 --> 00:00:48,963
(alarm beeping)

16
00:00:48,961 --> 00:00:51,531
(Sheldon:)That's it.

17
00:00:51,530 --> 00:00:52,800
(Penny:)That wasn't so bad.

18
00:00:52,798 --> 00:00:54,028
(Sheldon:)No, it wasn't.

19
00:00:54,033 --> 00:00:55,733
(Sheldon:)Uh, now let's tabulate

20
00:00:55,734 --> 00:00:57,034
(Sheldon:)the results of the experiment.

21
00:00:57,036 --> 00:00:58,736
(Penny:)Okay.

22
00:00:58,737 --> 00:01:02,707
(Sheldon:)I think it's safe to say that
you're not in love with me

